abstract: >
  Reproducible code, data, and figures (core set: GAK/GBARD benchmarking
  and the SEO->FORD field-of-research comparison) for a reanalysis of New
  Zealand's public R&D funding priorities against genuine Small Advanced
  Economy (SAE) peers, correcting the PMSITAC (2026) prioritisation 
  report's benchmarking methodology. Figure numbers (1, 2, 3, A1) match 
  "Impact of Refocusing FINAL.pdf" (Hendy, 2026). Includes an empirically-fitted 
  SEO->FORD crosswalk, corrected SAE comparator group, and multi-year GAK estimates 
  with leave-one-country-out uncertainty bands.
